                <pb facs="0740" n="652" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg652"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Russell to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-04-23"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 23,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Russell reports that he has been requested by the Panaman Government to
                    ascertain when the United States will make payment to Panama on account of the
                    canal indemnity.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
